## 4. 前端 `front/` 总览

```text
front/
├── check-env-variables.js        # 构建前校验 NEXT_PUBLIC_* 
├── tailwind.config.js              # brand/sage/cream/grey 令牌 + @medusajs/ui-preset
├── styles/globals.css
├── scripts/                        # clear-cache, dev-no-cache, cache-manager
