    ├── lib/                        # SDK、数据、工具、常量
    ├── modules/                    # 业务 UI（按域）
    └── types/global.ts
```

### 4.1 `app/` 路由表（页面文件）

| URL 模式 | 文件 | 数据源 |
|----------|------|--------|
| `/[cc]/` | `(main)/page.tsx` | Medusa 精选 |
| `/[cc]/store` | `(main)/store/page.tsx` | `listProducts` |
| `/[cc]/products/[handle]` | `(main)/products/[handle]/page.tsx` | `listProducts` + 模板分支 |
| `/[cc]/collections/[handle]` | `(main)/collections/[handle]/page.tsx` | collections |
| `/[cc]/categories/[...category]` | `(main)/categories/[...category]/page.tsx` | categories |
| `/[cc]/origins` | `(main)/origins/page.tsx` | Sanity |
| `/[cc]/origins/[slug]` | `(main)/origins/[slug]/page.tsx` | Sanity |
| `/[cc]/guides` | `(main)/guides/page.tsx` | Sanity |
| `/[cc]/guides/[slug]` | `(main)/guides/[slug]/page.tsx` | Sanity |
| `/[cc]/cart` | `(main)/cart/page.tsx` | cart |
| `/[cc]/checkout` | `(checkout)/checkout/page.tsx` | checkout（独立 layout） |
| `/[cc]/account` | `(main)/account/layout.tsx` | 并行路由见下 |
| `/[cc]/account` dashboard | `account/@dashboard/**` | customer |
| `/[cc]/account` login | `account/@login/page.tsx` | 未登录展示 |
| `/[cc]/order/[id]/confirmed` | `(main)/order/.../confirmed/page.tsx` | orders |
| `/[cc]/order/.../transfer/[token]/*` | transfer accept/decline | orders |

**Route Handlers（无 countryCode 前缀）**

| 路径 | 文件 | 职责 |
|------|------|------|
| `/api/revalidate` | `app/api/revalidate/route.ts` | Sanity Webhook；`x-revalidate-token`；按 type/slug 失效多国家路径 |
| `/api/preview` | `app/api/preview/route.ts` | 草稿预览入口 |
| `/api/cache` | `app/api/cache/route.ts` | 缓存调试/管理 |

**布局**：`app/layout.tsx` 根布局；`(main)/layout.tsx` 店铺壳；`(checkout)/layout.tsx` 精简结账壳。

