| `NEXT_PUBLIC_MEDUSA_PUBLISHABLE_KEY` | front | ✓ | Store API |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_REGION` | front |  | 默认 `us` |
| `SANITY_PROJECT_ID` / `SANITY_DATASET` | front | CMS 页 | |
| `SANITY_API_READ_TOKEN` | front | ✓ 读草稿/发布 | 仅服务端 |
